sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant M as FeedbackManager
    participant S as FeedbackStore
    participant D as Subscribers and handlers

    App->>M: submit(source, category, target, payload, ...)
    M->>S: store feedback
    alt idempotency key already stored
        S-->>M: original feedback
        M-->>App: original feedback, not processed again
    else new feedback
        S-->>M: stored feedback
        M->>D: notify subscribers and handlers
        M-->>App: stored feedback
    end
